cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this project in coursework or research, please cite it as below."
title: Car Rental Management System — Console Edition (C++17)
abstract: >-
  A dependency-free car rental management system in C++17 built on four
  hand-written data structures (AVL tree, hash table with chaining,
  binary-heap priority queue, doubly linked list). Features RBAC accounts,
  reservations with a waitlist, dynamic discounts, loyalty tiers, recurring
  series with pickup reminders, change-a-booking moves, audit logging,
  CSV/JSON persistence and monthly reports — with a 5,400+ check unit test
  suite, AddressSanitizer/UBSan coverage and a WebAssembly build of the same
  binary running in the browser.
